# 4. Aggregations

Very important for interviews.

Practice:

```sql
COUNT()
SUM()
AVG()
MIN()
MAX()
```

Example:

```sql
SELECT
    AVG(Salary) AS AverageSalary
FROM Employees;
```

Then:

```sql
SELECT
    DepartmentID,
    AVG(Salary) AS AverageSalary
FROM Employees
GROUP BY DepartmentID;
```

Then add:

```sql
HAVING
```

Example:

```sql
SELECT
    DepartmentID,
    AVG(Salary) AS AverageSalary
FROM Employees
GROUP BY DepartmentID
HAVING AVG(Salary) > 1000000;
```

