# 5. JOINs — Extremely Important

Master:

```text
INNER JOIN
LEFT JOIN
RIGHT JOIN
FULL OUTER JOIN
CROSS JOIN
SELF JOIN
```

Start here:

```sql
SELECT
    c.FirstName,
    o.OrderID,
    o.TotalAmount
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
    ON c.CustomerID = o.CustomerID;
```

Then master multi-table joins:

```text
Customers
   ↓
Orders
   ↓
OrderItems
   ↓
Products
```

This is exactly the kind of SQL you'll encounter in enterprise applications.

