# 10. DCL — Database Security

Learn:

```text
CREATE LOGIN
CREATE USER
CREATE ROLE
GRANT
REVOKE
DENY
```

This is particularly important for **GenAI SQL agents**.

For example, your AI agent should ideally have:

```text
AI Agent
   ↓
Read-only SQL User
   ↓
SELECT only
```

rather than:

```text
AI Agent
   ↓
DB Admin
   ↓
DROP TABLE 💥
```

A practical enterprise principle is:

> **Give an AI SQL agent the minimum permissions it needs.**

